    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dig Dig Boom </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dig Dig Boom</strong>\u00a0is a roguelike mining game where time only move when you do. The world consists of various tiles that all have different interactions with each other or the player's tools. It's up to the player to figure out how to best exploit these interactions to become a skilled dynaminer in search of treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026040/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.poster.avif?t=1751449882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026040/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.webm?t=1751449882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026040/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.mp4?t=1751449882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Time only moves when you do</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig Dig Boom is &quot;turn based&quot; in the classical Roguelike sense. Each time you take a move forward, so does the rest of the world. Take your time to think ahead before you blow up!<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Layers of interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Almost all tiles in the procedurally generated caves have some unique interaction with something else. Once you figure out these tricks, you can strategize with new mining techniques.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's currently a free demo of the game. This is based off an older version of the game while the newest version is under development, with far more features. You can wishlist the game to be notified when the full version releases!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dig Dig Boom </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dig Dig Boom</strong>\u00a0is a roguelike mining game where time only move when you do. The world consists of various tiles that all have different interactions with each other or the player's tools. It's up to the player to figure out how to best exploit these interactions to become a skilled dynaminer in search of treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026040/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.poster.avif?t=1751449882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026040/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.webm?t=1751449882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026040/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.mp4?t=1751449882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Time only moves when you do</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig Dig Boom is &quot;turn based&quot; in the classical Roguelike sense. Each time you take a move forward, so does the rest of the world. Take your time to think ahead before you blow up!<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Layers of interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Almost all tiles in the procedurally generated caves have some unique interaction with something else. Once you figure out these tricks, you can strategize with new mining techniques.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's currently a free demo of the game. This is based off an older version of the game while the newest version is under development, with far more features. You can wishlist the game to be notified when the full version releases!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dig Dig Boom is a roguelike mining game combining elements from grid-based puzzle games, turn-based strategy and classic dungeon crawlers. Take the role of a brave miner as you delve through procedurally generated caves to gather loot and evade danger.",
